  "description": "Lidar or Lidar H\u00f6y\u00fck is an archaeological site located in southeastern Anatolia, to the northwest of Sanliurfa, T\u00fcrkiye, and just southwest of the village of Lidar (district of Bozova). This settlement mound measured roughly 200x240 meters and stood 25 m high. Its remains are now inundated by the Atat\u00fcrk Dam.",
